## Creator's Message to the World 💜

This project was born from a simple belief: technology should protect and 
serve humanity. AfterLife represents my contribution to making the digital 
world a safer place for everyone.

I created this software not for profit, but with the genuine hope that it 
will help save lives, give peace of mind to families, and protect important 
digital information when people need it most.

To every developer who uses, improves, or contributes to this project:
Thank you for helping make the world a little bit safer.

May this code serve you well, and may you use it to serve others.

"Code with purpose, build with love, share with the world."

